## Overview
This repository contains the Week 6 deliverables for the HealthConnect project under the AnalystLab Africa Experience Lab.

Week 6 focused on Advanced Analytics and Decision Support, building on the Week 5 Power BI dashboard and analysis.

## Key Activities
- Deeper analysis of previous no-show history and reminder effectiveness
- Validation of high-risk segments
- Identification of the largest reminder gap (Diagnostic Test – 7.68 percentage points)
- Cross-track collaboration with Data Science
- Actionable business recommendations for HealthConnect Clinic

## Key Findings
- Overall no-show rate: 48.46%
- No-show rate increases with previous no-show history
- Reminders are associated with lower no-show rates across segments
- Diagnostic Test appointments show the largest reminder opportunity (7.68 pp gap)
- Data Science baseline model: 63% accuracy, 65% recall, ROC-AUC 0.68

## Deliverables
- Updated Power BI Dashboard (including Advanced Analysis page)
- Week 6 Advanced Analytics & Decision Support Report

